abstract: "Historical OpenStreetMap cafe availability and modeled CDC PLACES health outcomes in 23,527 census tracts across 50 populous US counties. Includes reproducible analyses, centroid proximity checks and an offline interactive atlas with conditional association scenarios. Original software is MIT-licensed; see LICENSES.md for component-specific terms."
